= V2 Sandbox =

This page is a public architecture test surface. It is not an encyclopedia article and does not establish production schema by itself.

== Synthetic knowledge object ==

; Entity type
: Concept

; Domains
: Systems science; Biology

; Epistemic status
: Draft

== Introduction ==
A short orientation should remain understandable without the rest of the page.

== Theory ==
A theory section explains the conceptual model without being confused with the page's entity type or domain.

== Evidence ==
Evidence belongs to the knowledge claim and its citations, not to a folder hierarchy.

== Applications ==
Applications show how the subject becomes useful in practice.

== References ==
References should be retrievable as a meaningful Book Matter unit.

== Test questions ==
* Can each section be selectively retrieved or transcluded?
* Can the page be classified without duplicating the same fact across namespaces, categories, and properties?
* Can relationships be queried semantically without harming human readability?
* Can a different entity type reuse the same architecture while using different Book Matter?

